Building sprite ("memory-unit.png") and base icon:
"Deep Storage Unit" (Memory Storage) mod, code by notnotmelon, graphics by
kaueNP, MIT. Taken from the factorio-unichest-large mod folder and
redistributed under the MIT terms (see graphics/LICENSE-DeepStorageUnit.txt).

Icon badges (down/up arrows): base-game (Factorio) arrow icons from
data/base/graphics/icons/arrows/, composited onto the memory-unit icon.
Same building icon for both variants, differentiated by a drop indicator --
the same approach Pyanodons uses on its caravan outposts.

Pipe port arrangement and the pipe stub follow the Pyanodons caravan outpost
geometry ("outpost-fluid" in Py Alien Life by Pyanodon, GNU GPLv3):
collision_box +/-2.9, selection_box +/-3, single south port at {0.5, 2.5},
verbatim pipe_picture. Layout compatibility is intentional: grids piped up
for Pyanodons caravans take these buildings drop-in. No Pyanodons code or
assets are included.

(An alternative design with distinct Exotic Space Industries buildings per
variant lives on the "initial-scaffold" branch, commit 8386fd7.)
